{"title":"Make the product homepage feel more polished","html":"<main><div class=\"learning-lab-page\"><div class=\"learning-lab-shell\"><header class=\"learning-lab-topbar\"><nav class=\"detail-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><button class=\"breadcrumb-link\" type=\"button\">VibeHub Skill</button><span class=\"breadcrumb-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">›</span><span class=\"breadcrumb-current\" aria-current=\"page\">Learning Lab</span></nav><span class=\"learning-generated\"><i class=\"ti ti-sparkles\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>Your Agent combined 4 interactions</span></header><section class=\"learning-intro\"><div class=\"learning-intro-context\">Combined exercise · An AI product homepage that is almost ready to launch</div><h1>Make the product homepage feel more polished</h1><p>Compare two approaches first, then decide what people should notice at first glance. When you finish adjusting, check the page based on how it actually feels—not the settings.</p><ol class=\"learning-route\" aria-label=\"Exercise steps\"><li class=\"is-current\">Compare</li><li class=\"\">Choose the first impression</li><li class=\"\">Adjust it</li><li class=\"\">Check the page</li></ol></section><section class=\"learning-stage\" aria-label=\"Combined interactive exercise\"><header class=\"learning-stage-header\"><div><small>Practicing · visual hierarchy</small><h2>Help the homepage communicate one clear thing</h2></div><button class=\"learning-reset\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"ti ti-refresh\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>Start over</button></header><div class=\"learning-product is-flat priority-value\" style=\"--learning-title:54px;--learning-gap:36px;--learning-muted:0.592\"><div class=\"learning-preview-caption\"><span>Page preview</span><b>Everything competes for attention</b></div><header class=\"learning-product-nav\"><span class=\"learning-product-brand\"><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>Example page</span><nav aria-label=\"Example page navigation\"><span>Product</span><span>Stories</span><span>Pricing</span></nav><span class=\"learning-product-login\">Log in</span></header><div class=\"learning-product-hero\"><div class=\"learning-product-copy\"><small>Made for independent creators</small><h2>Turn ideas into<br>work you can share</h2><p>From the first canvas to launch, keep your creative process in one calm, practical workspace.</p><div class=\"learning-product-actions\"><span>Start for free</span><span>View examples</span></div><div class=\"learning-product-proof\"><span><b>12,800</b> creators are using it</span><span><b>4.9</b> user rating</span></div></div><div class=\"learning-product-art\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"learning-art-orbit orbit-one\"></div><div class=\"learning-art-orbit orbit-two\"></div><div class=\"learning-art-card card-back\"><span></span><span></span></div><div class=\"learning-art-card card-front\"><i></i><strong>Spring Notes</strong><span></span><span></span></div><div class=\"learning-art-dot dot-one\"></div><div class=\"learning-art-dot dot-two\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"learning-compare-row\"><div class=\"learning-option-cards\" aria-label=\"Choose a page approach\"><button class=\"is-active\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><i class=\"ti ti-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><small>Option A</small><b>Everything competes for attention</b><span>Keep the heading, description, and buttons at a similar level of emphasis.</span></button><button class=\"\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><i class=\"ti ti-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i><small>Option B</small><b>Lead with one main point</b><span>Make the main heading and primary action the first things people notice.</span></button></div></div><div class=\"learning-observe-action\"><p>Switch between both approaches, then choose the direction that fits this page better.</p><button class=\"learning-choose\" type=\"button\">Choose this direction<i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button></div></section></div></div></main>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/en/vibehub-skill/lab"}